    {
      "component_id": "c_008",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "1. Gather information",
      "content_desc": "",
      "resource_id": "",
      "clickable": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "focusable": false,
      "bounds": [
        70,
        242,
        1370,
        318
      ]
    },
    {
      "component_id": "c_009",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "Before you start, talk to friends, consult with your pediatrician, and read up on different approaches. Remember there is no 'one size fits all' approach to potty training!",
      "content_desc": "",
      "resource_id": "",
      "clickable": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "focusable": false,
      "bounds": [
        133,
        318,
        1370,
        555
      ]
    },
    {
      "component_id": "c_010",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "2. Trust your instincts, be flexible!",
      "content_desc": "",
      "resource_id": "",
      "clickable": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "focusable": false,
      "bounds": [
        70,
        615,
        1370,
        691
      ]
    },
    {
      "component_id": "c_011",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "You are the expert on your child. Go with what you think will work best for your child and for you, and if it doesn't work, adjust!",
      "content_desc": "",
      "resource_id": "",
      "clickable": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "focusable": false,
      "bounds": [
        133,
        691,
        1370,
        871
      ]
    },
    {
      "component_id": "c_012",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "3. Give yourself time",
      "content_desc": "",
      "resource_id": "",
      "clickable": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "focusable": false,
      "bounds": [
        70,
        931,
        1370,
        1007
      ]
    },
    {
      "component_id": "c_013",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "Many preschools require children to be diaper free prior to enrollment, but children often operate on their own timeline! Build in some wiggle room into your schedule if you can.",
      "content_desc": "",
      "resource_id": "",
      "clickable": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "focusable": false,
      "bounds": [
        133,
        1007,
        1370,
        1244
      ]
    },
    {
      "component_id": "c_014",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "4. Aim for consistency",
      "content_desc": "",
      "resource_id": "",
      "clickable": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "focusable": false,
      "bounds": [
        70,
        1304,
        1370,
        1380
      ]
    },
    {
      "component_id": "c_015",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "Set up your potty training routine and rewards structure (if you choose to use one), but don\u2019t worry too much if you can\u2019t stick to it every day. Life happens.",
      "content_desc": "",
      "resource_id": "",
      "clickable": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "focusable": false,
      "bounds": [
        133,
        1380,
        1370,
        1560
      ]
    },
    {
      "component_id": "c_016",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "5. Celebrate every step",
      "content_desc": "",
      "resource_id": "",
      "clickable": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "focusable": false,
      "bounds": [
        70,
        1620,
        1370,
        1696
      ]
    },
    {
      "component_id": "c_017",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "Potty training is a process. Start by celebrating the little things, like sitting on the potty for a few seconds at a time. Then move on to celebrating longer sits or first successes as your child catches on and improves with time.",
      "content_desc": "",
      "resource_id": "",
      "clickable": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "focusable": false,
      "bounds": [
        133,
        1696,
        1370,
        1990
      ]
    },
    {
      "component_id": "c_018",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "6. Allow for do-overs",
      "content_desc": "",
      "resource_id": "",
      "clickable": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "focusable": false,
      "bounds": [
        70,
        2050,
        1370,
        2126
      ]
    },
    {
      "component_id": "c_019",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "If there\u2019s a major interruption in your family\u2019s schedule, and your child needs the comfort of the old routine, or you sense your child is just not ready yet, it\u2019s OK to hang up the undies for a while.",
      "content_desc": "",
      "resource_id": "",
      "clickable": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "focusable": false,
      "bounds": [
        133,
        2126,
        1370,
        2363
      ]
    },
    {
      "component_id": "c_020",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "7. Encourage independence",
      "content_desc": "",
      "resource_id": "",
      "clickable": false,
      "enabled": true,
      "focusable": false,
      "bounds": [
        70,
        2423,
        1370,
        2499
      ]
    },
    {
      "component_id": "c_021",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "Help your child set a timer or Potty Watch to remind him to go. Give stickers or rewards when he remembers to go, whether it's with the help of a timer or all on his own!",
